# Build inputs and outputs of the brand kit that stay out of the repository (#410).
# Committed: the master SVGs (src/), the generator, BRAND.md, and the outputs this
# repository uses: web/ (favicons, app and manifest icons), share/ (Open Graph and
# X cards) and github/ (README banners, social preview). Everything else ships in
# the downloadable kit zip that `node build.mjs` writes.
node_modules/
.cache/
fonts/
social/
listings/
business/
slack-discord-apps/
contact-sheet-*.png
renderweld-brand-kit.zip
